cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline or its data snapshot, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "NDC-Level Comparison of Mark Cuban Cost Plus Drug Company Pricing Against the CMS National Average Drug Acquisition Cost Benchmark: An Automated Open-Source Pipeline"
abstract: "Weekly-refreshing pipeline that retrieves the complete Cost Plus Drugs catalog from the company's public pricing API, matches each product by 11-digit National Drug Code to the CMS NADAC weekly reference file, and computes fee-exclusive and fee-inclusive price comparisons against acquisition cost and an AWP-derived retail cash floor. Includes the interactive catalog explorer, the multi-tab analysis workbook, and the script that reproduces the tables and figure reported in the accompanying manuscript."
authors:
